                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5115c794-2dfa-40f5-8ce4-0e87babcecf8",
                                                "sense_id": "93c25a2a-6572-3b8c-8c0b-5ab0be638b81",
                                                "text": "In terms of diversity, cephalopods include the egg case making argonauts, shelled nautiluses, venomous blue-ringed octopuses and enigmatic giants like the giant and colossal squid. […] Generally, cephalopod ink includes melanin, enzymes related to melanin production, catecholamines, peptidoglycans, free amino acids and metals (Derby 2014) ."
                                            }
